{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Release in winter 2025!!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_1.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Re:Night is a roguelike deck-building tactical RPG. In each roguelike adventure, players must construct their decks and defeat a variety of powerful enemies, from slimes to vampires, on a 2D tactical battlefield. Rushdown, OTK, Control \u2014 all can turn the tide of battle and help you break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, players control three characters simultaneously during combat, allowing for unique tactical RPG maneuvers like flanking, blocking, ganking and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come to this town, end the loop of nights and bring back the dawn! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_2.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players control three characters simultaneously in each battle, enabling them to specialize: one can tank damage on the front lines, another can unleash devastating attacks from the back, and a third can flank from the sides. On rich and engaging maps, leverage your characters' unique traits and utilize various environmental elements to secure victory through strategic wit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/6e8bd93ccee046b0a9d3e1f495bf4979.poster.webp?t=1751977274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/6e8bd93ccee046b0a9d3e1f495bf4979.webp?t=1751977274\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_3.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character boasts a large collection of unique class cards. With over 300 cards, dozens of equipment and items, and each character's distinctive talents, you can assemble a wide array of decks, from aggressive rushdown to mid-range, OTK, and control archetypes. Use your creativity to utterly devastate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/91e84adc45b9f326a175e4678a23fbe2.poster.webp?t=1751977274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/91e84adc45b9f326a175e4678a23fbe2.webp?t=1751977274\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_4.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a damage burst mechanism with Fire, Water, and Grass elements, allowing you to easily deal massive elemental damage. How to land elemental critical hits, how to prevent enemies from doing the same \u2014 the back-and-forth is like a chess match between grandmasters; everything requires careful planning and adaptive improvisation based on the situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/41e8e777baba71a6afe9a8e403601799.poster.webp?t=1751977274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/41e8e777baba71a6afe9a8e403601799.webp?t=1751977274\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_5.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game is a fresh experience, with diverse maps, events, battles, and encounters awaiting players' exploration. Through successive adventures, gradually unlock more content and new characters. Discover your characters' past through the Disk of Loop, draw closer to the truth of the night, and unravel the mystery of the loop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/95a92b029d7176ab4d7da494c5c4524b.poster.webp?t=1751977274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/95a92b029d7176ab4d7da494c5c4524b.webp?t=1751977274\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2372240?t=1751977274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2372240?t=1751977274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/877df4bb6dc2fd2438bae0ac40330020f3f2f139/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751977274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/877df4bb6dc2fd2438bae0ac40330020f3f2f139/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751977274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Release in winter 2025!!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/c_1.png?t=1751977274\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Re: